# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# social-commerce-frontend — Environment Variables
#
# IMPORTANT — Vite build-time vs runtime:
#   Variables prefixed with VITE_ are embedded into the JS
#   bundle at BUILD TIME by Vite. They are NOT runtime env
#   vars — the nginx container cannot change them after build.
#
# RAILWAY DEPLOYMENT:
#   Set VITE_API_URL in Railway's "Variables" tab on the
#   frontend service BEFORE the build runs. Railway passes
#   it as a build ARG automatically.
#
# LOCAL DEV (pnpm dev / vite):
#   Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the value.
#   .env.local is gitignored and never committed.
#
# LOCAL DOCKER (docker-compose):
#   Passed as build ARG in docker-compose.yml — no file needed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── Backend API base URL ──────────────────────────────────────
# Must include /api/v1 — matches the prefix in axiosConfig.js
#
# Local dev:          http://localhost:8080/api/v1
# Railway production: https://your-backend-name.up.railway.app/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1
